<h2>1. What is an RSS Feed?</h2>
<p>RSS (Really Simple Syndication) allows you to subscribe to technical writeups and blog updates without needing social media or email tracking. New articles deliver automatically to your favorite RSS reader (e.g., Feedly, NetNewsWire, Inoreader, or Thunderbird).</p>

